# The trust surface hashes locked files byte-for-byte (sha256 in
# .safeinstall/trust-surface.lock). A CRLF checkout on Windows would change
# those bytes and report false drift on every clone, so all text files
# materialize with LF on every platform. All 102 tracked files were already
# LF in the index when this was added; no renormalization was needed.
* text=auto eol=lf
